pack personal-compression-ledger
generation control-1
provenance Personal food and housing tooling census, 2026-08-26; doctrine promoted 2026-08-26
authority asserted
note Every measure below is UNMEASURED. Personal is not deferred optimization work. It is the second real non-model dataset, with a completely different shape from Upper90, which is what makes it worth proving the doctrine on. Food and Housing are at different maturities and their ledgers say so.

ledger led:personal
  estate bonfyre/personal
  state UNMEASURED
  gate_ref optimization-proof
  detail Every new estate gets an optimization plan covering semantic state, relationships, history, latent state, artifacts, queries, execution, context, models and network movement. This is that plan for Personal.

target tgt:food-observation
  ledger led:personal
  namespace bonfyre/personal/food
  source_state REAL
  source_shape a thousand observations should not become a thousand products
  observed_invariant most of an observation repeats: retailer, store, brand, product, package
  observed_variance little changes: price, promotion, availability
  proposed_form product basis: product identifier, brand, category, package, normalized identity
  proposed_form retailer basis: retailer identifier
  proposed_form store basis: store identifier, retailer reference, location
  proposed_form offer occurrence: product reference, store reference, timestamp, price, promotion reference, availability bits
  acceptance a repeat observation with an unchanged product at an unchanged store stores approximately the price delta
  invariant the raw scrape remains evidence and is never the runtime database
  cheap_stage_role tokenize a scraped title into candidate attributes before exact entity resolution
  measure raw scraped bytes
  measure unique products, retailers and stores
  measure bytes per observation
  measure duplicate body collapse across repeated images and boilerplate
  measure delta ratio
  measure embedding bytes per product
  measure candidate reduction from exact filtering before similarity
  state UNMEASURED

target tgt:housing-observation
  ledger led:personal
  namespace bonfyre/personal/housing
  source_state TOOLING
  source_shape nine observation tools exist; no materialized observation bodies were found in the census
  observed_invariant address, operator, building identity, amenity baseline and location are stable across observations
  observed_variance rent, term, concession, availability and fees change
  proposed_form property basis: address, operator, building identity, persistent amenity baseline, location
  proposed_form unit basis: floorplan, beds, baths, square footage
  proposed_form offer occurrence: unit reference, time, rent, term, concession, availability, fee delta
  worked_example a rent moving from one value to another and a concession moving from six weeks to eight should store approximately that change, not another copy of the property page
  cheap_stage_role classify a phrase such as a stated free-weeks offer as carrying a candidate contract term, before the exact lease grammar parses it
  measure raw listing bytes
  measure unique properties and units
  measure price and offer observations
  measure bytes per changed offer
  measure duplicate image and floorplan collapse
  measure history compression ratio
  measure latent bytes per property
  measure hydration amplification
  state UNMEASURED
  blocked_on materialized observations; the capability to observe exists, the observations do not

target tgt:personal-latent-bases
  ledger led:personal
  source_shape one independent full-precision vector per instance
  proposed_form a shared basis per family plus a per-instance residual
  family_example a product approximated by a category basis, a brand basis and a product residual
  family_example a property approximated by a property-type basis, an operator basis, a neighborhood transform and a property residual
  claim only the residual may need a per-instance vector
  selection_protocol optimization-proof representation_selection_protocol
  expectation_note one family may prove that integer quantization suffices while another needs product quantization or half precision; selection is measured per family and never defaulted
  measure baseline bytes against selected bytes at equal retrieval quality
  state UNMEASURED

target tgt:personal-body-dedup
  ledger led:personal
  source_shape identical media and documents repeated across observations
  candidate identical listing images
  candidate identical product images
  candidate identical floorplans
  candidate identical lease documents
  candidate identical retailer boilerplate
  candidate identical page fragments
  proposed_form one physical body, many semantic references
  ordering deduplicate first, compress second
  measure unique bodies against total references
  state UNMEASURED

target tgt:personal-external-boundary
  ledger led:personal
  namespace bonfyre/personal/external
  source_state DECLARED
  detail The external estate is empty and must stay structurally honest as it fills.
  invariant a public observation, a personal relationship and a realization rail are three separate subjects
  worked_example a retailer selling an item, holding an account with that retailer, and placing an order through a rail are three facts and are never collapsed into one
  state UNMEASURED

anti_target private_data_movement
  detail Method and capability may move between Personal and any other estate. Personal data never moves with them.
anti_target aperture
  detail Compression never widens the owner aperture. A household boundary added later is a delegation decision, not a representation decision.
